WEBVTT

00:00:00.584 --> 00:00:02.002
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:04.337
Eli-chi and the others learned
that the school's closure

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:06.464
hinges on the results of its open campus.

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:10.260
In response to this state of emergency,
M's asked Eli-chi to act as their coach.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.761
Me, your dance instructor?

00:00:11.761 --> 00:00:14.556
She was confident that the girls would be
unable to handle her intense workout,

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:16.516
but they were determined to keep up.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.185
Their determination moved Eli-chi...

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:22.314
Eli-senpai, please join J's.

00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:24.441
We'd love it if you'd sing with p's...

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:25.775
as a fellow school idol!

00:00:26.318 --> 00:00:30.113
And so, with the additions of Eli-chi and
myself, u's now has nine members.

00:00:30.113 --> 00:00:32.699
I heard the open campus was a big hit.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:34.159
Wow, really?

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:36.328
Kotori-chan!

00:00:36.328 --> 00:00:38.038
Umi-chan!

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.581
Amazing news!

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:41.541
I've got a big scoop for you!

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:44.085
After looking over the open campus surveys,

00:00:44.085 --> 00:00:48.423
they're going to wait a bit longer to decide
whether or not to close our school!

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:49.382
That means...!

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:53.303
It means that the girls who came to see us
ended up interested in enrolling here!

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:53.970
Yeah!

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:57.390
But...things don't end there, you see...

00:00:58.224 --> 00:00:59.267
Ta-da!

00:01:00.185 --> 00:01:02.937
We got a bigger club room!

00:01:03.855 --> 00:01:05.649
Spin, spin, spin!

00:01:05.649 --> 00:01:07.233
Good times, good times.

00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:10.153
This is no time to act relaxed.

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:11.404
Eli-senpai.

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:15.867
If the number of interested students isn't
significant, our school is still at risk.

00:01:15.867 --> 00:01:17.077
Let's keeping working hard.

00:01:19.954 --> 00:01:21.247
I'm elated...

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:24.626
Finally, someone else with proper
ethics has joined our club!

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:28.880
That makes us sound like
uncontrollable animals.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:30.840
Isn't it time to begin practice?

00:01:31.675 --> 00:01:33.218
Sorry...

00:01:33.218 --> 00:01:36.346
I gotta leave early today.

00:01:39.307 --> 00:01:41.351
Sorry again. See ya tomorrow!

00:01:43.561 --> 00:01:44.604
What was that?

00:01:45.063 --> 00:01:48.775
Kotori-chan's been going home
early kinda often lately.

00:02:08.712 --> 00:02:13.842
<i>Massugu ha omoi ga minna wo musubu Our honest
feelings are what will fie us all together.</i>

00:02:13.842 --> 00:02:18.680
Honki demo bukiyou butsukari au kokoro Even with
our clumsy sincerity, our hearts will still collide.

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:23.476
Sore demo mitaiyo ohkina yume wa And despite
it all, we want to dream a really grand dream.

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:28.064
Koko ni aruyo hajimatta bakari That dream
is here, and it has only now just begun!

00:02:28.064 --> 00:02:29.149
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:33.027
Tanoshii dakejanai tamesarerudarou That it's not
all fun and games— we'll face a lot of obstacles.

00:02:33.027 --> 00:02:34.028
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:02:34.028 --> 00:02:37.824
Datte sono kurushisa mo mirai That those
hardships will be paving our futures...

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:38.908
ikundayo
So here we go!

00:02:38.908 --> 00:02:42.996
Atsumattara tsuyoi jibun ni nattekuyo If we all
join together, we'll be able to become stronger.

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:47.625
(Kittone) kawari tsuzukete (WE'LL BE A STARY/) (We're sure
that) we will all grow and mature. (We'll become stars!)

00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:52.630
Sorezore ga sukina koto de ganbarerunara That's why we feel
that if we give the things that we love the most our all,

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:57.302
atarashii (basho ga) gohru dane what awaits
then (our new place) will be our goal.

00:02:57.302 --> 00:03:02.474
Sorezore no sukina koto wo shinjiteireba That's why we
feel that if we believe in the things we love in our lives,

00:03:02.474 --> 00:03:07.437
tokimeki wo (daite) susumerudarou we can learn to
love (then embrace) our butterflies and advance!

00:03:07.437 --> 00:03:12.942
(kowagaru kuse wa sutechae) tobikiri no egao de So crumple up your
fears, throw them away, and then just put on your brightest smiles!

00:03:12.942 --> 00:03:20.533
(tonde tonde takaku) bokura wa ima no naka de (Higher and higher
we"ll fly) The lights that are shining within our hearts...

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:25.288
kagayaki wo matteta
They're waiting to brighten the world.

00:03:27.081 --> 00:03:30.084
Otonokizaka High Idol Study Club
M's (Muse) Whoooooa, 50th place?

00:03:30.084 --> 00:03:31.961
I can't believe it! It's too awesome!

00:03:31.961 --> 00:03:33.505
A dream come true!

00:03:33.671 --> 00:03:35.590
We're getting close to the top 20!

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:36.841
It is amazing...

00:03:36.841 --> 00:03:41.054
Since you joined, Eli-senpai, it seems
we've gained more female fans.

00:03:42.305 --> 00:03:43.264
I know, right?

00:03:43.515 --> 00:03:47.602
#9 - Wonder Zone You're tall, with legs that
go on forever, and you're a natural beauty.

00:03:47.602 --> 00:03:49.562
More than that, though, you're mature.

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:51.564
Now that's what I call a third year!

00:03:51.564 --> 00:03:52.857
Enough already.

00:03:53.483 --> 00:03:55.652
Wait... What?

00:03:55.652 --> 00:03:57.445
Um, nothing.

00:03:58.154 --> 00:04:01.074
She has the tendency to be oblivious, though.

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:05.370
Like the other day, she almost ate a
plastic chocolate bar, thinking it was real.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:06.371
Nozomi!

00:04:06.371 --> 00:04:08.206
But you really are beautiful.

00:04:08.206 --> 00:04:09.666
We gotta diet!

00:04:09.666 --> 00:04:11.668
I'm tired of hearing that one.

00:04:11.668 --> 00:04:14.671
Hey, Honoka!

00:04:15.588 --> 00:04:16.923
You can do it!

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:17.966
Fight on!

00:04:17.966 --> 00:04:19.968
We love p's!

00:04:19.968 --> 00:04:21.886
Thanks!

00:04:21.886 --> 00:04:22.720
Do you know them?

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:27.308
Yeah. They've been supporting us
since our first concert.

00:04:27.308 --> 00:04:29.686
Things are just starting to
get difficult now, though.

00:04:30.478 --> 00:04:33.273
The higher our rating, the more
fans it means we have.

00:04:33.898 --> 00:04:35.400
You're right.

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:36.943
So, 20th place, huh?

00:04:36.943 --> 00:04:42.490
We need to do something huge to bump our
rank that far up in a short period of time.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:47.370
Shouldn't we focus on something else first?

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:48.204
What?

00:04:50.123 --> 00:04:51.457
So...

00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:53.668
This getup is really hot.

00:04:53.668 --> 00:04:54.711
Suck it up, kid.

00:04:55.086 --> 00:04:57.547
This is the path that all idols tread.

00:04:57.547 --> 00:05:02.218
The famous must dress appropriately so
they're able to blend in with the normals.

00:05:02.218 --> 00:05:03.553
But this is a bit...

00:05:03.553 --> 00:05:05.555
I feel this has the opposite effect.

00:05:05.555 --> 00:05:06.848
This is idiotic.

00:05:06.848 --> 00:05:11.352
Even if you're not "on the clock," understand
that people will be looking at you regardless.

00:05:11.352 --> 00:05:13.771
It's only natural if you're
aiming to be a top idol.

00:05:14.772 --> 00:05:15.899
I see.

00:05:16.941 --> 00:05:19.277
This is amazing!

00:05:31.789 --> 00:05:34.000
Kayo-chin, that's A-RISE.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.209
What's this place?

00:05:35.209 --> 00:05:37.253
You live so close, but you're this ignorant!?

00:05:37.253 --> 00:05:41.007
This is a specialty shop dealing in
school idol goods that opened recently.

00:05:41.007 --> 00:05:42.592
School Idol Shop
I can't believe such a specific store exists.

00:05:42.592 --> 00:05:45.762
School idols are popular enough for
Love Live to have been created.

00:05:45.762 --> 00:05:49.015
Only a few of these types of
stores exist in Akiba, though.

00:05:49.015 --> 00:05:50.266
Look!

00:05:50.642 --> 00:05:53.061
The girl on this button is so cute.

00:05:53.061 --> 00:05:54.687
She looks just like Kayo-chin, huh!?

00:05:54.687 --> 00:05:56.189
They could even be twins!

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:58.733
Wait, that might actually be...

00:05:58.733 --> 00:06:00.026
That is Hanayo-chan!

00:06:00.026 --> 00:06:01.069
What!?

00:06:01.069 --> 00:06:02.654
U's Corner
Explosively popular! Plenty of stock.

00:06:03.488 --> 00:06:05.114
New ltems
No way!

00:06:05.365 --> 00:06:08.159
U-Umi-chan, th-that's us!

00:06:08.159 --> 00:06:09.786
C-Calm down!

00:06:09.786 --> 00:06:11.704
I-It says p's!

00:06:11.704 --> 00:06:13.373
They got any mousse?

00:06:13.373 --> 00:06:16.751
Wh-Why would they sell
m-m-mousse at an idol shop?

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:18.586
Outta my way!

00:06:18.586 --> 00:06:20.546
What!? I can't find any goods of me!

00:06:20.546 --> 00:06:22.173
What is this crap!?

00:06:24.634 --> 00:06:26.344
My goods...!

00:06:27.845 --> 00:06:29.639
Whoa! Nico-senpai's really crying!

00:06:29.639 --> 00:06:31.849
-That's Kotori-chan.
- Shut up!

00:06:32.183 --> 00:06:36.479
Realizing we have so many people
watching us is rather encouraging.

00:06:36.479 --> 00:06:37.230
Yes.

00:06:39.774 --> 00:06:42.068
I-I'm so happy.

00:06:42.068 --> 00:06:43.903
There you go again, Kayo-chin...

00:06:44.362 --> 00:06:46.322
What a crybaby.

00:06:48.783 --> 00:06:49.909
Excuse me!

00:06:50.952 --> 00:06:53.454
I heard you have a picture...

00:06:53.454 --> 00:06:56.040
Um, well, I heard you have a picture of me...

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.377
I can't allow you to sell that.
Please remove it immediately!

00:07:00.003 --> 00:07:01.045
Kotori-chan...?

00:07:05.967 --> 00:07:08.636
Kotori, what is the meaning of this?

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.185
Koe-tour-y? Whazzat?

00:07:16.185 --> 00:07:18.021
Who be dat?

00:07:18.521 --> 00:07:19.939
A foreigner!

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.608
Kotori-chan, it's you—

00:07:22.608 --> 00:07:24.360
Nein.

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:27.864
Adios, mon ami.

00:07:27.864 --> 00:07:32.201
You ladies be sure to take good
care of yourselves, yep, yep...

00:07:32.702 --> 00:07:33.536
Good-bye!

00:07:35.663 --> 00:07:36.789
Kotori-chan!

00:07:38.666 --> 00:07:39.250
Wait!

00:07:44.881 --> 00:07:46.215
Kotori-chan!

00:07:49.969 --> 00:07:51.971
Huh? She vanished.

00:07:58.394 --> 00:08:00.980
I'm so smart, pre-planning an escape route!

00:08:07.403 --> 00:08:08.696
There you are.

00:08:09.655 --> 00:08:13.951
Attempt to flee, and I'll grab onto
those full breasts of yours.

00:08:15.536 --> 00:08:17.622
I'm so sorry!

00:08:19.749 --> 00:08:21.459
What!?

00:08:23.377 --> 00:08:30.468
K-Kotori-senpai, you're the legendary
Akihabara maid, Minalinsky-san!?

00:08:31.344 --> 00:08:32.386
That's me...

00:08:32.386 --> 00:08:36.140
You're so lame, Kotori-chan!
You should've told us sooner!

00:08:37.141 --> 00:08:40.770
If you had, we totally would've come
see you to get free drinks!

00:08:40.770 --> 00:08:41.646
That's the issue?

00:08:41.646 --> 00:08:43.564
Where did this picture come from?

00:08:43.564 --> 00:08:46.234
They made me sing at one
of the store's events.

00:08:46.234 --> 00:08:49.362
Photography was supposed to be prohibited.

00:08:49.362 --> 00:08:50.822
Oh, I see.

00:08:50.822 --> 00:08:53.282
So you're not going solo on us?

00:08:53.282 --> 00:08:55.034
No, of course not.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:56.911
Then, why?

00:08:57.745 --> 00:09:01.499
It was around the time we started p's...

00:09:01.999 --> 00:09:05.419
Wh-What? There's no way
I could work a part-time job...

00:09:06.462 --> 00:09:07.755
This is adorable...!

00:09:07.755 --> 00:09:09.465
Welcome back!

00:09:09.715 --> 00:09:12.802
I wanted to change myself somehow.

00:09:12.802 --> 00:09:17.223
Unlike Honoka-chan and Umi-chan,
there's nothing really special about me.

00:09:17.223 --> 00:09:18.850
Nothing special?

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:25.815
I can't be an energetic leader like you,
and I'm not collected like Umi-chan.

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:27.984
That's not true.

00:09:27.984 --> 00:09:30.444
You're a really good singer and dancer.

00:09:30.444 --> 00:09:33.948
And you design all our costumes, don't forget.

00:09:33.948 --> 00:09:37.451
If nothing else, you're the most
normal second year I know.

00:09:37.451 --> 00:09:38.619
No...

00:09:40.079 --> 00:09:43.583
I'm just walking in my two
best friends' shadows...

00:09:50.006 --> 00:09:51.382
See ya later!

00:09:54.802 --> 00:09:57.013
Please don't tell my mom!

00:09:57.013 --> 00:09:58.181
Or say anything at school!

00:10:00.349 --> 00:10:01.309
Gotcha!

00:10:08.441 --> 00:10:13.112
I had no idea Kotori-chan was
worried about something like that.

00:10:13.112 --> 00:10:16.490
It may surprise you to hear
that most girls are like that.

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:22.622
Well, I mean, most people tend to
think of themselves as fairly average.

00:10:23.539 --> 00:10:26.042
That's why we all work hard to improve.

00:10:26.042 --> 00:10:27.001
I see.

00:10:27.919 --> 00:10:30.004
That makes sense.

00:10:30.004 --> 00:10:35.885
We grow little by little, inspired to try harder
when we see those around us growing.

00:10:36.219 --> 00:10:39.931
Friends are nothing more than
amicable rivals, in that sense.

00:10:43.643 --> 00:10:47.438
I'm truly glad for you to have
joined y's, Eli-senpai.

00:10:47.438 --> 00:10:50.191
Wh-Where did that come from?

00:10:50.191 --> 00:10:53.569
Don't butter me up to ask me to go easy
on you during practice tomorrow.

00:10:55.655 --> 00:10:56.989
Until then.

00:10:58.491 --> 00:11:00.117
See you tomorrow.

00:11:01.118 --> 00:11:06.624
Hey, Umi-chan, have you ever looked at me
and thought you needed to work harder?

00:11:07.208 --> 00:11:09.502
- Countless times.
- Really!?

00:11:09.502 --> 00:11:12.505
But you can beat me at like, everything.

00:11:12.505 --> 00:11:14.465
What makes you think that way?

00:11:15.341 --> 00:11:17.510
It's frustrating, so I try to keep this secret.

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:18.511
What?

00:11:18.511 --> 00:11:22.598
You and Kotori...are my biggest rivals.

00:11:22.598 --> 00:11:23.391
Huh?

00:11:24.767 --> 00:11:26.143
Umi-chan...

00:11:27.061 --> 00:11:28.479
You're right!

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:33.693
Eli-chi.

00:11:35.319 --> 00:11:36.320
What is it?

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:38.197
Why the urge to come back here?

00:11:38.739 --> 00:11:40.741
I thought of something, that's all.

00:11:41.826 --> 00:11:44.912
While walking these streets,
I realized something.

00:11:45.329 --> 00:11:50.209
This place constantly gobbles up what's
"new and hot" and changes frighteningly fast.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:54.005
This place accepts any and all things...

00:11:54.505 --> 00:11:57.300
It may prove to be an ideal place...

00:12:00.219 --> 00:12:02.555
for our next stage.

00:12:13.399 --> 00:12:14.692
Love Live!

00:12:25.411 --> 00:12:28.247
Chocolate parfait—so sweet.

00:12:28.247 --> 00:12:31.375
Crackly-crumbly crepe—I wanna eat.

00:12:32.251 --> 00:12:34.086
It's a spotted cat!

00:12:34.086 --> 00:12:39.300
Cutesy, five-toed socks—they feel nice.

00:12:41.635 --> 00:12:44.388
I can't think of anything good!

00:12:44.388 --> 00:12:45.765
A concert in Akiba.

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:47.600
What? You mean...

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:48.851
A street performance?

00:12:48.851 --> 00:12:49.560
Yes.

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:52.021
Akiba is A-RISE territory.

00:12:52.355 --> 00:12:53.814
And why it makes this interesting.

00:12:53.814 --> 00:12:55.483
It's a pretty bold move to make.

00:12:55.858 --> 00:12:57.902
Akiba is the Mecca of idol otaku.

00:12:57.902 --> 00:13:03.074
If we put on a great performance there,
it will significantly boost our popularity.

00:13:03.074 --> 00:13:04.367
This idea rocks!

00:13:04.367 --> 00:13:05.576
Sounds like fun!

00:13:06.243 --> 00:13:08.537
But won't there be a massive crowd...?

00:13:08.537 --> 00:13:11.123
No point in performing if nobody's there.

00:13:11.123 --> 00:13:11.957
True, but...

00:13:11.957 --> 00:13:14.877
- I'm all for it!
- M-Me, too.

00:13:14.877 --> 00:13:15.711
It's decided.

00:13:16.796 --> 00:13:18.547
Let's pick a date.

00:13:18.547 --> 00:13:19.840
Before that...

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:26.806
I feel our lyrics this time around should be
penned by someone who knows Akiba well.

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:29.517
Don't you agree, Kotori-san?

00:13:29.517 --> 00:13:30.935
Wait, you mean me!?

00:13:30.935 --> 00:13:31.894
Yes.

00:13:33.104 --> 00:13:36.107
You've been working in that area
for some time now, correct?

00:13:36.107 --> 00:13:40.403
I'm sure you can create lyrics that will
speak to the hearts of those who go there.

00:13:40.403 --> 00:13:42.571
That's great! This idea is only getting better!

00:13:42.571 --> 00:13:44.115
Honoka-chan...

00:13:44.115 --> 00:13:45.825
You should give it a try.

00:13:45.825 --> 00:13:49.370
You'll be able to write very cute
lyrics suitable for the Akiba clientele.

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:53.749
I want to sing something in your
sweet, fluffy style, Kotori-senpai.

00:13:53.749 --> 00:13:55.126
R-Really?

00:13:55.126 --> 00:13:57.378
Write some amazing lyrics.

00:13:57.378 --> 00:13:58.838
I'm excited to read them.

00:13:58.838 --> 00:13:59.922
You can do this.

00:13:59.922 --> 00:14:01.340
O-Okay...

00:14:03.676 --> 00:14:07.555
Fluffy-fluffy stuff is always super cute, yay!

00:14:07.555 --> 00:14:14.770
Line up lots of macarons to make
yourself colorful and happy...

00:14:18.816 --> 00:14:22.319
- There's no way I can do this!
- She seems to be struggling.

00:14:22.319 --> 00:14:23.070
Yeah.

00:14:27.366 --> 00:14:29.785
Honoka-chan...

00:14:29.785 --> 00:14:33.164
Freedom of Speech
Compose something using this concept.

00:14:34.457 --> 00:14:35.791
Let's see...

00:14:36.292 --> 00:14:37.334
Minami-san.

00:14:40.421 --> 00:14:41.672
Minami Kotori-san!

00:14:41.672 --> 00:14:42.506
Y-Yes!

00:14:42.506 --> 00:14:43.507
Uh, um...

00:14:46.093 --> 00:14:49.180
I dunno what to write...

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:51.140
You're thinking too hard.

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:54.810
Why not write something that's
light and fluffy, like Umi-chan does?

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:56.979
Is that supposed to be a compliment?

00:14:56.979 --> 00:14:58.397
You bet.

00:14:59.899 --> 00:15:01.734
Our break's almost over.

00:15:05.571 --> 00:15:08.032
If D = 0, there are multiple roots.

00:15:08.032 --> 00:15:12.328
If D <0, there are two
different imaginary solutions.

00:15:12.328 --> 00:15:15.247
Minami, you've been pretty
scatterbrained recently.

00:15:15.247 --> 00:15:16.499
Pull yourself together.

00:15:17.082 --> 00:15:18.459
I'm sorry.

00:15:33.098 --> 00:15:34.850
I can't...

00:15:43.984 --> 00:15:45.110
Kotori-chan!

00:15:46.028 --> 00:15:47.029
Honoka-chan.

00:15:47.029 --> 00:15:50.866
Let's come up with something
together using a special method!

00:15:50.866 --> 00:15:51.909
What?

00:15:52.201 --> 00:15:57.414
Welcome back, Master.

00:15:57.831 --> 00:16:01.001
Welcome back, Master...

00:16:02.002 --> 00:16:03.587
Cuteness overload!

00:16:03.587 --> 00:16:05.422
That was perfect, you two.

00:16:05.923 --> 00:16:09.093
My boss said she'd be happy
to have you both help out.

00:16:09.093 --> 00:16:11.470
I had a feeling this would happen to me...

00:16:13.013 --> 00:16:14.640
We're here.

00:16:15.766 --> 00:16:19.520
So you're going to think up your
lyrics about Akiba, in Akiba.

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:22.189
So begins our rockumentary.

00:16:22.189 --> 00:16:24.024
No, please! Why are you all here!?

00:16:24.024 --> 00:16:25.276
I invited them.

00:16:25.276 --> 00:16:27.861
Hurry up and take my order, servants.

00:16:29.071 --> 00:16:30.155
Welcome.

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:36.078
A table for two, is it?

00:16:36.787 --> 00:16:38.998
Follow me, please.

00:16:41.542 --> 00:16:43.460
Here's your table.

00:16:44.503 --> 00:16:46.088
Here's our menu.

00:16:47.631 --> 00:16:50.175
I'll bring you some water right away.

00:16:51.218 --> 00:16:52.845
Excuse me.

00:16:57.433 --> 00:16:59.685
Truly, this is the legendary maid...

00:16:59.685 --> 00:17:01.729
Minalinsky...

00:17:05.399 --> 00:17:07.067
That looks okay.

00:17:07.067 --> 00:17:08.110
Umi-chan.

00:17:08.527 --> 00:17:11.697
You've done nothing but wash
people's dishes back here!

00:17:11.697 --> 00:17:13.907
Go chat with the customers!

00:17:13.907 --> 00:17:15.534
I'm doing my job, aren't 1?

00:17:15.534 --> 00:17:19.455
This is the true work of a maid, you see.

00:17:19.455 --> 00:17:21.290
Grasping for straws, much?

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:23.459
Umi-chan, could you wash these next?

00:17:23.459 --> 00:17:24.501
Understood.

00:17:24.501 --> 00:17:28.505
Bad Umi-chan! You gotta smile
while you're here, okay?

00:17:28.505 --> 00:17:30.090
But this is...

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:34.887
Even if you're not in front of any customers,
it's important to keep the attitude consistent.

00:17:34.887 --> 00:17:36.430
I-I see...

00:17:38.557 --> 00:17:42.061
Kotori-chan, you act a little different
here, compared to usual.

00:17:42.061 --> 00:17:44.063
Huh? You think so?

00:17:44.063 --> 00:17:45.397
Like a different girl!

00:17:45.397 --> 00:17:47.274
You're more lively and stuff!

00:17:48.192 --> 00:17:53.155
Yep. Wearing this outfit makes me
feel like I can do anything.

00:17:53.489 --> 00:17:57.201
Coming to this place shows me
wonders and gives me courage.

00:17:58.077 --> 00:18:05.501
I feel like this district will accept me,
no matter who I become...

00:18:06.126 --> 00:18:08.462
That's how being here makes me feel.

00:18:09.129 --> 00:18:10.297
And why I love it.

00:18:14.468 --> 00:18:16.637
Well there ya go, Kotori-chan!

00:18:16.637 --> 00:18:17.179
What?

00:18:17.179 --> 00:18:21.350
Take those words you just said and
mash 'em together to make song lyrics!

00:18:21.684 --> 00:18:27.147
What you feel when you see this
district, these streets, everything...

00:18:27.147 --> 00:18:34.321
Take all that you feel and think,
and make those into the song!

00:18:35.114 --> 00:18:37.032
WONDER ZONE...

00:18:37.032 --> 00:18:43.330
I heard you calling for me,
so I came running over.

00:18:43.706 --> 00:18:52.631
I'm sure a dream swaddled in
mystery will soon unfold.

00:18:52.631 --> 00:18:58.762
Yes, it has begun (this wondrous feeling)!
- Is this really happening...? - Of course. This very spot, next Sunday.

00:18:58.762 --> 00:19:02.266
It's so mysterious, but it's so special— - But all the people...
- It'll be fun!

00:19:02.266 --> 00:19:04.977
My dream. - What?
- Let's do it!

00:19:05.269 --> 00:19:08.313
Please Cheer p's On! We're putting on
a street concert! I'd love to energize you,

00:19:08.313 --> 00:19:10.274
and make tomorrow HAPPY.
We're going to Akiba dressed like this?

00:19:10.274 --> 00:19:13.944
We want to have fun
Nico-Nico-Ni! This suits me, huh?

00:19:13.944 --> 00:19:17.531
And get our hearts to flutter!

00:19:17.948 --> 00:19:23.537
Even if we get too intense,
go overboard, slip, and fall...

00:19:24.246 --> 00:19:30.377
we'll bounce right back to our feet with our biggest smiles!
- This is the end of the line! - Welcome. This way, please.

00:19:31.712 --> 00:19:36.258
It doesn't matter how great
the pains we face are—

00:19:36.258 --> 00:19:44.433
If we don't dry our eyes and keep trying,
we'll never get to shine!

00:19:44.933 --> 00:19:46.769
WONDER ZONE...

00:19:46.769 --> 00:19:52.441
The intense future in which we
grow and become that strong...

00:19:52.441 --> 00:19:58.030
If we're searching together, I'M OK!

00:19:58.030 --> 00:20:05.037
I heard you urgently calling for me,
so I came running over.

00:20:05.037 --> 00:20:11.001
I'm sure a dream far, far larger
than life will soon unfold.

00:20:11.001 --> 00:20:15.672
Yes, it has begun (this wondrous feeling)!

00:20:15.672 --> 00:20:24.181
It's so mysterious, but it's
so special—my dream.

00:20:30.062 --> 00:20:32.022
I'm glad it went well.

00:20:32.022 --> 00:20:33.982
All thanks to you, Kotori-chan.

00:20:33.982 --> 00:20:36.026
No, no... I didn't do anything, really.

00:20:36.819 --> 00:20:38.946
It's thanks to you all for being there with me.

00:20:38.946 --> 00:20:41.073
Because we wrote that song together.

00:20:41.073 --> 00:20:43.242
I don't think that's true.

00:20:43.242 --> 00:20:46.078
But...maybe I'll play along and say it is.

00:20:46.078 --> 00:20:47.079
Honoka.

00:20:47.079 --> 00:20:49.373
Yes, please. That would make me happiest.

00:20:49.373 --> 00:20:50.415
Kotori.

00:21:02.302 --> 00:21:08.725
When we line up like this, doesn't it
remind you of our very first concert?

00:21:08.725 --> 00:21:09.768
Yeah.

00:21:09.768 --> 00:21:13.105
It was just us three back then...

00:21:14.398 --> 00:21:15.899
So, I've been thinking...

00:21:16.733 --> 00:21:20.863
About...how long we can
all be together like this...

00:21:20.863 --> 00:21:22.698
That's pretty random.

00:21:22.698 --> 00:21:26.034
But we'll graduate high school in two years.

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:28.620
No helping that, really.

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:36.336
It's cool. We'll be together forever!

00:21:36.670 --> 00:21:42.342
I wanna be with you and
Umi-chan forever and ever.

00:21:42.718 --> 00:21:43.969
I love you!

00:21:45.137 --> 00:21:46.513
Honoka-chan...

00:21:48.432 --> 00:21:49.850
I love you, too!

00:21:52.436 --> 00:21:54.563
Let's be friends forever!

00:21:54.563 --> 00:21:55.355
Yeah!

00:22:15.083 --> 00:22:20.714
Sunao ni oikakete yuukide oikakete Chase after
it with honesty, chase after it with courage.

00:22:20.964 --> 00:22:26.261
Chiisana negai ga ashita wo tsukuru That one
small wish is what will help to create tomorrow.

00:22:26.595 --> 00:22:32.684
Dekirukamo minna ga nozomunara It might
be possible if we all want it to come true.

00:22:32.684 --> 00:22:39.650
Dare yori ganbacchae tonikaku Jjounetsu no mama ni Give it
more effort than anyone else and stay as passionate as ever.

00:22:39.650 --> 00:22:44.696
Mezasu no wa kireina kaze fuku michi Let's aim to
find our path while riding on a beautiful wind.

00:22:45.614 --> 00:22:51.161
Hane no youni ude agete Spread your
arms out wide like they're your own wings.

00:22:51.161 --> 00:22:56.416
Mabushii mirai e to tobuyo We'll use
them to take off into our bright future.

00:22:57.626 --> 00:23:03.924
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ni kikoeru You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, you can hear it in this one moment.

00:23:04.299 --> 00:23:09.554
Egao nara itsu no hi mo daijoubu As long as
we see you smiling, every day is worth it!

00:23:09.554 --> 00:23:15.978
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ga mitaine You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, we want to see you at that moment.

00:23:15.978 --> 00:23:21.817
Tonari ni kimi ga ite (ureshii keshiki) I want you
to be right beside me. (It's such happy scenery.)

00:23:21.817 --> 00:23:27.239
Tonari wa kimi nanda
Only when the one right there is you.

00:23:35.956 --> 00:23:39.960
Next time on Love Live!
"No Senpai Allowed!"
